# Group Contact

Represents contact details. 

---
**Contact attributes:**

- id `(Number)`
- consultant_id `(Number)`: represents `My contact` category consultant
- deceased `(Boolean)`
- permit_email `(Boolean)`
- permit_email_blast `(Boolean)`
- permit_sms `(Boolean)`
- first_name `(String)`
- last_name `(String)`
- salutation `(String)`
- attention `(String)`
- legal_name `(String)`
- phone_bh `(String)`
- phone_ah `(String)`
- mobile `(String)`
- email `(String)`
- company `(Boolean)`
- created_at `(String)`: date & time of the contact creation in DB (in ISO 8601 format)
- address `(Object)`
    - id `(Number)`: Property ID
    - unit `(String)`
    - number `(String)`
    - street_name `(String)`
    - street_type `(String)`
    - suburb `(String)`
    - postcode `(String)`
    - state `(String)`
    - country `(String)`
    - latitude `(Number)`
    - longitude `(Number)`
- categories `(Array)`
    - id `(Number)`
    - type_id `(Number)`
    - consultant_id `(Number)`
    - name `(String)`
- notes `(Array)`
    - id `(Number)`
    - consultant_id `(Number)`
    - text `(String)`
- criteria `(Array)`
    - id `(Number)`
    - type `(String)`
    - suburbs `(Array)`
      - name `(String)`
      - postcode `(String)`
      - state `(String)`
    - property_type_ids `(Array)`
    - property_category_ids `(Array)`
    - price_from `(Number)`
    - price_to `(Number)`
    - house_size_from `(Number)`
    - house_size_to `(Number)`
    - house_measure `(String)`
    - land_size_from `(Number)`
    - land_size_to `(Number)`
    - land_measure `(String)`
    - return_pa_from `(Number)`
    - return_pa_to `(Number)`
    - notes `(String)`
    - created_at `(String)`: date & time of the criteria creation in DB (in ISO 8601 format)
    - updated_at `(String)`: : date & time of the criteria updation in DB (in ISO 8601 format)

---

