# Group Contact Categories

Represents contact category details.

---
**Contact category type attributes:**

- type_id `(Number)`: Contact Category Type ID
- consultant_id `(Number)`
---

## Contact Category collection [/contacts/{contact_id}/categories]

### Create a contact category [POST]

This endpoint can be used to assign contact category to a contact. The request must contain either `type_id` or `name`.

---
**Attributes:**

- type_id `(Number *required)` - Required if `name` is not submitted.
- name `(String *required)` - Category type name. A new category type will be created if a category type with this name in the `consultant_id` office group does not exist. Required if `type_id` is not submitted.
- consultant_id `(Number required)`

---

+ Parameters

    + contact_id (required, integer, `12`) ... Contact ID


+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

    + Body

            {
                "contact_category: {
                    "type_id": 14,
                    "consultant_id": 3
                }
            }


+ Response 201 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {
                "id": 7352
            }


+ Response 400 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {"errors":{"name":["is too long (maximum is 100 characters)"]}}
            

## Remove by Contact Category ID [/contacts/{contact_id}/categories/{id}]

### Remove a contact category [DELETE]

This endpoint can be used to remove contact category from a contact by the contact category id.

+ Parameters

    + contact_id (required, integer, `12`) ... Contact ID
    + id (required, integer, `519`) ... Contact Category ID

+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {}
            
            

## Remove by Name [/contacts/{contact_id}/category]            
            
### Remove a contact category by Name [DELETE]

This endpoint can be used to remove contact category from a contact by the category name. `consulant_id` is required. 
Note: this endpoint will respond with success if the contact has no category with the category `name` in the request.

+ Parameters

    + contact_id (required, integer, `12`) ... Contact ID


+ Request (application/json)

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

    + Body

            {
                "contact_category: {
                    "consultant_id": 3
                    "name": "foobar"
                }
            }


+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {}

