### List all tasks [GET]

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Parameters

    + after (optional, string, `1520452907_37`) ... Paging cursor returned in the last response

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "subject": "Task 1",
                    "task_type": "Task",
                    "task_date": "2018-12-04",
                    "consultant_id": 1,
                    "contact_ids": [8],
