## Appraisals collection [/appraisals?{after}]

### List [GET]

Retrieve paginated list of appraisals.

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Parameters

