# Group Inspection Attendances

Represents inspection attendance.

---
**Inspection attendance attributes:**

- id `(Number)`
- contact_id `(Number)`
- inspection_details `(Object)`
    - id `(Number)`
    - inspection_date `(Date)`
    - start_time `(Time)`
    - end_time `(Time)`
    - sales_listing_id `(Number)` 
- comments `(Array)`
    - id `(Number)`
    - comment `(String)`
    - consultant_id `(Number)`
    - created_at `(String)` (in ISO 8601 format)

## Inspection Attendances collection [/inspection_attendances?{after}]

### List [GET]

Retrieve paginated list of inspection attendances.

+ Request

    + Headers

            Authorization: Api-Key token=b3c7623c3ad30d34fec6226f90914b0af125dc06

+ Parameters

    + after (optional, string, `1520452907_37`) ... Paging cursor returned in the last response

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "data": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "contact_id": 2,
                    "inspection_details": {
                        "id": 112,
                        "inspection_date": "2022-02-18",
                        "start_time": "16:00",
                        "end_time": "16:30"
                        "sales_listing_id": 123
                    },
                    "comments": [{
                        "id": 1234,
                        "comment": "Foo bar",
                        "consultant_id": 56,
                        "created_at": "2021-10-11T13:13:37+11:00"
                    }],
                }
            ],
            "paging": {
                "next": "https://your-domain.boxdice.com.au/aire_api/inspection_attendances?after=1520848432_100"
            }
        }


